{"ref":"BDB, מַחְתָּה","hw":"מַחְתָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְתָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. fire-holder, censer, snuff-dish</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.12\">Lv 16:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:11\" href=\"/Numbers.17.11\">Nu 17:11</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְתָּתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 10:1\" href=\"/Leviticus.10.1\">Lv 10:1</a> + 4 times; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְתּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:6\" href=\"/Numbers.16.6\">Nu 16:6</a> + 4 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְתֹּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:17\" href=\"/Numbers.16.17\">Nu 16:17</a> + 3 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְתּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:3\" href=\"/Numbers.17.3\">Nu 17:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:4\" href=\"/Numbers.17.4\">4</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְתֹּתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:3\" href=\"/Exodus.27.3\">Ex 27:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְתֹּתֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:38\" href=\"/Exodus.25.38\">Ex 25:38</a> + 2 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>snuff-holder</em>, snuff-dish (Now<sup>Archäol. ii, 63. 65</sup>) of gold <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:38\" href=\"/Exodus.25.38\">Ex 25:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:23\" href=\"/Exodus.37.23\">37:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:9\" href=\"/Numbers.4.9\">Nu 4:9</a> (all P).<br><strong>2.</strong>  bronze utensils, <em>fire-pans</em>, belonging to altar of burnt-offerings <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:3\" href=\"/Exodus.27.3\">Ex 27:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:3\" href=\"/Exodus.38.3\">38:3</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:14\" href=\"/Numbers.4.14\">Nu 4:14</a> (all P); <em>fire-pans</em> of gold <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:50\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.50\">1 K 7:50</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.22\">2 Ch 4:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.15\">2 K 25:15</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.19\">Je 52:19</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>censer</em>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 10:1\" href=\"/Leviticus.10.1\">Lv 10:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.12\">16:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:6\" href=\"/Numbers.16.6\">Nu 16:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:17\" href=\"/Numbers.16.17\">17</a><sup>(×4)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:18\" href=\"/Numbers.16.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:2\" href=\"/Numbers.17.2\">17:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:3\" href=\"/Numbers.17.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:4\" href=\"/Numbers.17.4\">4</a> (of bronze), v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:11\" href=\"/Numbers.17.11\">11</a> (all P).","next":"BDB, חִתָּה","prev":"BDB, מַ֫חַת"}